## 8. What needs to be cleaned?

The main thing that needs to be cleaned is the size of the file.

`BattleManager.cs` is very important, but it is also very large. In the future, it could be split into smaller scripts to make it easier to read, test, and maintain.

Possible cleanup ideas:

- Move reward logic into a separate `BattleRewardHandler`.
- Move status effect resolution into a separate `BattleStatusResolver`.
- Move action and counter resolution into a separate `BattleActionResolver`.
- Move HUD update formatting into a separate presentation/helper class.
- Keep `BattleManager` focused mainly on controlling the battle flow.

This would make the battle system easier to debug and easier to extend later.
